<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-PROFILE OF THOMAS SYKORA.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-PROFILE OF THOMAS SYKORA.</headline>
<dateline>PARK CITY, Utah 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profile of Thomas</p>
<p>Sykora, who won the World Cup men's slalom at Park City, Utah,</p>
<p>on Sunday:</p>
<p>Age: 28</p>
<p>Nationality: Austrian</p>
<p>Prior victories: Two -- Kitzbuehel 1996, Lillehammer 1996</p>
<p>Other: A tall man with long legs, Sykora looks ungainly in</p>
<p>the gates. &quot;I know it's ugly, but it works,&quot; says Sykora, who</p>
<p>laughs easily and is the team entertainer.</p>
</text>
